  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{T}=2 \\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{ML}^{3}}{3 \\mathrm{Yq}}},$ writing dimensions of both\nthe sides, we get $[\\mathrm{T}]=\\left[\\frac{\\mathrm{ML}^{3}}{\\mathrm{ML}^{-1} \\mathrm{~T}^{-2} \\mathrm{q}}\\right]^{1 / 2}$\nor $\\quad q=\\left[L^{4}\\right]$",
    "image": null
